{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SPRITE LOAD 1, \"Graphics/Sprites/hero.png\"\n    SPRITE POS 1, 160, 120\n    SPRITE ALPHA 1, 0          ; Start invisible\n    SPRITE ON 1\n    SPRITE FADE 1, 255, 120     ; Fade in over 120 frames (~2 s at 60 fps)\n\nMainLoop:\n    IF FADING(1) = 0 THEN\n        ; The sprite is fully visible - run the game\n        IF KEYSTATE(\"Space\") = 1 THEN\n            SPRITE FADE 1, 0, 20   ; Snabb fade ut (0.33 sek)\n        ENDIF\n    ENDIF\n\n    WAIT VBL                   ; Sprite fades are updated here automatically\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}